### EX-tickets-list | View every support ticket
GET http://localhost:8002/api/tickets

### EX-tickets-create | Open a support ticket
POST http://localhost:8002/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Unable to sign in"}

### EX-tickets-get | Look up one support ticket
GET http://localhost:8002/api/tickets/1

### EX-tickets-close | Close an existing support ticket
PATCH http://localhost:8002/api/tickets/1/close
